      "message": "This error is useful for debugging, but requires the module to have knowledge of every possible dependency tag that might get added to a module (as seen by the android.DefaultsDepTag and android.SourceDepTag references above).  The constant SourceDepTag has been replaced with a sourceOrOutputDependencyTag that carries additional information, so to keep this check we would need to replace the tag \u003d\u003d android.SourceDepTag check with a type comparison, which doesn\u0027t fit into the switch structure and requires checking implementation details of the tag.\n\nWe\u0027ve already removed these \"check that all dependency tags are known\" checks from other module types, since they inherently require knowing implementation details of every feature in Soong that uses dependency tags.\n\nThis hunk had to be moved to the previous patch to fix build issues there.",
